The experimental EmbeddingGemma 2 file transcription option includes adapted
audio preprocessing and inference code from john-rocky/eg2-transcribe,
revision e9c1c2653ff2ebe81447394b3cf22e407433dbed, licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0:
https://github.com/john-rocky/eg2-transcribe
AirTranslate modifications include bounded file decoding, cancellation,
validated model installation, and integration with the settings interface.

The optional models are downloaded separately from
mlboydaisuke/EmbeddingGemma-2-Transcribe-CoreAI, revision
76865ae46793e05617c2a7420454b0c7eb8541a4. Their LICENSE and NOTICE are
retained with the downloaded models. They contain Google's EmbeddingGemma 2
audio encoder and the independently trained reader v2 by mlboydaisuke
(john-rocky). EmbeddingGemma 2 deployments must adhere to the Gemma Prohibited
Use Policy: https://ai.google.dev/gemma/prohibited_use_policy
